WEBVTT

00:01:08.860 --> 00:01:10.980
SWORD GAI

00:01:39.640 --> 00:01:40.760
What power!

00:01:42.310 --> 00:01:44.730
<i>Run, Miki! You can't fight him alone!</i>

00:01:44.810 --> 00:01:46.390
I-I know that!

00:02:08.620 --> 00:02:11.210
As expected
of the lightning sword Fallgon.

00:02:12.130 --> 00:02:14.250
It won't be that easy, huh?

00:02:20.510 --> 00:02:23.600
That was close.
So, that's Zsoltgewinn, huh?

00:02:24.180 --> 00:02:25.720
I thought I was done for.

00:02:27.310 --> 00:02:28.310
I-I-It's gone!

00:02:29.060 --> 00:02:30.060
The Azoth Sword!

00:02:31.190 --> 00:02:32.690
Him, huh?

00:02:38.070 --> 00:02:39.320
Administrator Miura.

00:02:48.960 --> 00:02:50.170
<i>Kill.</i>

00:02:51.210 --> 00:02:52.460
<i>Kill.</i>

00:02:54.000 --> 00:02:56.840
Is this... the Shiryu?

00:03:11.520 --> 00:03:14.560
Enough. Raise your head, Gai.

00:03:19.360 --> 00:03:21.570
But I don't understand.

00:03:22.280 --> 00:03:24.830
Why use the Shiryu on someone like me?

00:03:29.040 --> 00:03:31.960
When I found you as a baby,

00:03:32.040 --> 00:03:37.210
you tightly held the Shiryu
as if it were your lifeline.

00:03:37.960 --> 00:03:40.590
The Shiryu is your guardian sword.

00:03:41.760 --> 00:03:46.350
Now it will serve as your right arm
and protect you.

00:03:48.810 --> 00:03:50.390
If you feel remorse,

00:03:50.480 --> 00:03:54.900
become a swordsmith and craft
a greater sword than the Shiryu, Gai.

00:03:55.980 --> 00:03:59.150
Yes sir, I'll do my best.
Even if it kills me.

00:04:09.040 --> 00:04:09.870
Gai.

00:04:10.660 --> 00:04:15.000
I'm glad you're doing better.
I was worried for a bit.

00:04:16.250 --> 00:04:18.000
Master is a fool.

00:04:20.090 --> 00:04:22.380
Destroying the Shiryu for me...

00:04:22.470 --> 00:04:25.180
But father did it for your sake!

00:04:25.260 --> 00:04:27.140
I'm not worthy of it.

00:04:29.060 --> 00:04:31.680
That's the Shiryu's scabbard.

00:04:31.770 --> 00:04:33.350
Master gave it to me.

00:04:33.440 --> 00:04:37.980
He must want you to craft a sword
worthy of that scabbard someday!

00:04:40.820 --> 00:04:41.780
G-Gai!

00:04:42.940 --> 00:04:45.070
The Shiryu is one of a kind.

00:04:45.910 --> 00:04:47.240
It cannot be reforged.

00:04:50.660 --> 00:04:52.750
Master, I don't understand!

00:04:53.540 --> 00:04:55.330
Why waste the Shiryu on Gai?

00:04:56.170 --> 00:04:58.420
I understand how you feel.

00:04:58.500 --> 00:05:03.010
But a sword is just a tool,
and people are more important than tools.

00:05:03.090 --> 00:05:07.510
B-But the Shiryu is alive!
It's not just a tool!

00:05:08.180 --> 00:05:13.560
And that's why the Shiryu and Gai
are bound by an incomprehensible fate.

00:05:13.930 --> 00:05:18.520
I believe the Shiryu wanted
to become Gai's arm.

00:05:18.610 --> 00:05:19.900
That's absurd!

00:05:19.980 --> 00:05:25.700
Also, I want to see how Gai lives,
now that the Shiryu is a part of him.

00:05:26.360 --> 00:05:28.700
I've been a swordsmith for 40 years,

00:05:28.780 --> 00:05:32.200
but I've yet to craft a sword
that I'm truly satisfied with.

00:05:32.700 --> 00:05:38.960
But if Gai lives his life as a sword,
he may become my masterpiece.

00:05:39.960 --> 00:05:42.710
Master, is Gai that important to you?

00:06:27.300 --> 00:06:29.680
It wasn't a dream.

00:06:37.520 --> 00:06:40.310
The teachings
of the ancient magics weren't wrong.

00:06:41.770 --> 00:06:45.230
There are powers in this world
beyond human imagining.

00:06:47.490 --> 00:06:50.700
To have my revenge,
I will take that power...

00:06:51.990 --> 00:06:54.240
with my own hands.

00:06:54.330 --> 00:06:55.620
Brother, I'm coming in!

00:06:56.540 --> 00:06:59.370
How long are you gonna sleep?
It's already noon.

00:07:08.970 --> 00:07:10.430
How is it, Marcus?

00:07:11.220 --> 00:07:14.550
I made today's omelettes Spanish style!

00:07:15.260 --> 00:07:19.310
They've got green peppers, gross!
Here, you can have mine, Brother.

00:07:19.390 --> 00:07:22.690
Hey, how long are you going
to let Marcus spoil you?

00:07:23.650 --> 00:07:25.020
Such a silly girl.

00:07:25.610 --> 00:07:28.650
It's okay! Brother is my everything!

00:07:28.740 --> 00:07:34.120
Hey Marcus, it's been a while,
but want to go fishing on Sunday?

00:07:34.740 --> 00:07:35.990
I want to go too!

00:07:36.080 --> 00:07:37.660
Then I'll make lunches!

00:07:37.990 --> 00:07:38.950
Enough.

00:07:40.290 --> 00:07:41.410
What's wrong, Marcus?

00:07:41.750 --> 00:07:44.040
I said that's enough! Get out!

00:07:46.290 --> 00:07:50.220
I'll wire the money to your accounts.
So, please...

00:07:50.840 --> 00:07:53.430
Have we done something wrong?

00:07:53.510 --> 00:07:56.930
That's a shame.
Everything was going so smoothly.

00:07:57.220 --> 00:08:01.850
Shall we get new staff?
You could pick from photos on the website.

00:08:02.440 --> 00:08:04.150
Perhaps a younger mother--

00:08:04.230 --> 00:08:07.440
Stop it! I'm sick of having a fake family!

00:08:07.900 --> 00:08:09.650
Get out! Get out, now!

00:08:38.510 --> 00:08:42.680
What's wrong, Azoth Sword?
Why... why won't you answer me?

00:08:43.440 --> 00:08:46.190
Please! Please, give me power!

00:08:50.820 --> 00:08:53.150
Marcus Lithos, age 22.

00:08:53.990 --> 00:08:55.950
A Japanese citizen born in America.

00:08:56.360 --> 00:09:00.040
He studied history at Imperial University
before dropping out.

00:09:00.120 --> 00:09:02.660
Hold on, what's this about an accident?

00:09:03.330 --> 00:09:07.040
Marcus was in a car accident
while on vacation two years ago.

00:09:07.130 --> 00:09:09.500
He lost his parents and younger sister.

00:09:10.090 --> 00:09:14.670
Also, he was paralyzed below the waist.
He's not expected to recover.

00:09:15.220 --> 00:09:18.850
It seemed like
Marcus knew about the Azoth Sword.

00:09:19.800 --> 00:09:21.890
I hope it's not too late.

00:09:23.730 --> 00:09:27.100
I didn't expect you to come.
I'm surprised.

00:09:27.190 --> 00:09:28.350
Is it a bother?

00:09:28.650 --> 00:09:31.070
Of course not, I'm happy.

00:09:31.440 --> 00:09:35.360
I'm sorry. You contacted me so many times,
but I didn't answer.

00:09:35.780 --> 00:09:38.320
Yeah, I wanted to say something.

00:09:40.950 --> 00:09:42.370
I heard from Tanabe.

00:09:42.740 --> 00:09:45.330
You two are getting married, right?
Congratulations.

00:09:46.790 --> 00:09:48.580
Do you really feel that way?

00:09:49.330 --> 00:09:50.420
Of course!

00:09:50.920 --> 00:09:53.920
My ex-girlfriend
and best friend are getting married.

00:09:54.260 --> 00:09:55.590
I couldn't be happier.

00:09:56.090 --> 00:09:56.930
Thank you.

00:09:57.510 --> 00:09:59.930
I had a feeling you'd say that.

00:10:00.600 --> 00:10:04.600
You'll definitely invite me
to the wedding, right?

00:10:05.430 --> 00:10:09.100
Actually...
he wants to have a private wedding.

00:10:10.110 --> 00:10:11.440
He does, huh?

00:10:11.520 --> 00:10:12.610
I'm sorry.

00:10:12.690 --> 00:10:14.480
You don't need to apologize.

00:10:15.030 --> 00:10:16.360
Congratulations anyway.

00:10:17.280 --> 00:10:20.450
I'll be praying for your happiness,
with all my heart.

00:10:45.060 --> 00:10:50.060
Sorry to butt in to your date, Erika.

00:10:50.150 --> 00:10:53.020
It's alright.
Only Marcus has my attention.

00:10:54.360 --> 00:10:57.030
You dummy. I'm in love with Marcus too!

00:11:08.500 --> 00:11:12.040
Traitors. You'll pay. You'll pay.

00:11:12.500 --> 00:11:13.500
You'll pay!

00:11:26.180 --> 00:11:31.270
I can feel the flames of hatred,
a bloodlust that eats at the body.

00:11:31.520 --> 00:11:33.940
I shall grant your wish.

00:11:47.450 --> 00:11:48.830
Welcome back, miss.

00:11:52.830 --> 00:11:53.790
Tatsumi?

00:11:55.040 --> 00:11:57.590
It's going to rain, so I came to get you.

00:11:58.170 --> 00:12:01.930
Th-Thank you very much.
But I think it'll be fine.

00:12:02.800 --> 00:12:05.760
No, I'm sure it will rain. I can smell it.

00:12:09.640 --> 00:12:12.940
You always come straight home
after school, don't you?

00:12:13.850 --> 00:12:15.980
You don't hang out with your friends?

00:12:16.060 --> 00:12:19.070
Yes, I have a lot of work to do here.

00:12:19.900 --> 00:12:23.610
That's wonderful, miss.
You'll make a great wife.

00:12:25.110 --> 00:12:29.450
Oh, and don't worry.
I turned that offer down.

00:12:30.370 --> 00:12:31.450
Offer?

00:12:32.120 --> 00:12:34.920
To go back home
and look for someone to marry.

00:12:35.380 --> 00:12:37.460
I'll be with you forever.

00:12:38.670 --> 00:12:39.880
I just felt rain...

00:12:47.100 --> 00:12:48.890
What are you doing, Tatsumi?

00:12:49.470 --> 00:12:52.390
I love you, miss! I can't help it!

00:12:52.680 --> 00:12:56.150
S-Stop it! I'll tell my father!

00:12:56.230 --> 00:12:57.860
Master betrayed me!

00:12:58.440 --> 00:13:02.400
I gave my life to serve him,
but he loves Gai more than me!

00:13:04.490 --> 00:13:07.320
So I'm taking you, instead!

00:13:14.750 --> 00:13:15.710
G-Gai?

00:13:16.500 --> 00:13:18.880
What the hell do you think you're doing?

00:13:19.920 --> 00:13:20.750
Nothing.

00:13:21.300 --> 00:13:24.630
Gai, it's your fault. It's your fault I...

00:13:33.220 --> 00:13:34.060
<i>Kill.</i>

00:13:35.060 --> 00:13:35.890
<i>Kill.</i>

00:13:36.560 --> 00:13:37.400
<i>Kill.</i>

00:13:38.270 --> 00:13:39.110
<i>Kill.</i>

00:13:39.860 --> 00:13:40.690
<i>Kill.</i>

00:13:41.570 --> 00:13:42.400
<i>Kill.</i>

00:13:43.070 --> 00:13:43.900
<i>Kill.</i>

00:13:44.780 --> 00:13:45.610
<i>Kill.</i>

00:13:46.070 --> 00:13:46.900
<i>Kill.</i>

00:13:47.490 --> 00:13:48.320
<i>Kill.</i>

00:13:48.530 --> 00:13:49.370
<i>Kill.</i>

00:13:49.570 --> 00:13:50.990
<i>-Kill!
-Stop it, Gai!</i>

00:14:03.340 --> 00:14:04.170
<i>Kill.</i>

00:14:04.840 --> 00:14:05.760
<i>Kill.</i>

00:14:05.840 --> 00:14:06.800
Shut up!

00:14:08.970 --> 00:14:09.800
<i>Kill.</i>

00:14:10.300 --> 00:14:11.140
<i>Kill.</i>

00:14:11.430 --> 00:14:12.260
<i>Kill.</i>

00:14:12.850 --> 00:14:16.770
<i>-Kill.
-Shut up!</i>

00:14:16.850 --> 00:14:18.270
<i>-Kill!
-Stop it, Gai!</i>

00:14:23.940 --> 00:14:26.030
<i>The voice of the Shiryu is gone!</i>

00:14:35.790 --> 00:14:39.790
Do you, Toshio Tanabe,
swear your love to this woman,

00:14:40.290 --> 00:14:42.670
Erika Saeki, in sickness and in health?

00:14:43.460 --> 00:14:44.300
I do.

00:14:44.960 --> 00:14:48.800
Do you, Erika Saeki,
for richer or for poorer,

00:14:49.130 --> 00:14:51.680
swear your love to this man,
Toshio Tanabe?

00:14:52.470 --> 00:14:53.300
I do.

00:14:54.100 --> 00:14:56.100
Then let us exchange the rings--

00:14:56.180 --> 00:14:57.100
Wait.

00:15:01.850 --> 00:15:02.810
M-Marcus.

00:15:13.490 --> 00:15:14.450
Marcus?

00:15:14.740 --> 00:15:16.450
OGATA HOUSEHOLD

00:15:16.540 --> 00:15:19.330
I see, so Master Amon isn't in.

00:15:19.410 --> 00:15:21.330
Will you give this to him then?

00:15:21.790 --> 00:15:22.710
What's that?

00:15:23.380 --> 00:15:27.420
The Tonbokiri spear.
I was asked to sharpen it.

00:15:28.170 --> 00:15:29.130
Tonbokiri?

00:15:29.760 --> 00:15:32.140
A legendary spear.

00:15:32.220 --> 00:15:37.140
It's so sharp, a dragonfly that landed
on the blade was sliced in half.

00:15:44.060 --> 00:15:45.020
Marcus.

00:15:45.150 --> 00:15:47.110
You... can walk?

00:15:47.400 --> 00:15:50.900
Yeah, I sure can. And that's not all.

00:15:51.650 --> 00:15:53.360
I can run! I can kill!

00:15:55.580 --> 00:15:58.240
You aren't my girlfriend
and my best friend!

00:15:58.330 --> 00:16:00.790
You're liars and traitors!

00:16:01.830 --> 00:16:03.830
Die!

00:16:11.470 --> 00:16:14.180
Looks like you're one of us, now.

00:16:14.470 --> 00:16:15.600
That's a shame.

00:16:15.680 --> 00:16:17.600
Don't get in my way!

00:16:18.010 --> 00:16:18.850
Run!

00:16:19.060 --> 00:16:19.930
Marcus!

00:16:20.020 --> 00:16:21.680
You idiot, hurry and run!

00:16:21.770 --> 00:16:22.690
This way!

00:16:43.580 --> 00:16:44.500
Fallgon!

00:17:00.060 --> 00:17:01.310
Stop, Marcus!

00:17:07.980 --> 00:17:08.940
Marcus.

00:17:14.950 --> 00:17:16.700
I can't do it!

00:17:23.450 --> 00:17:25.040
It's okay.

00:17:25.790 --> 00:17:28.580
What... What do I do?

00:17:29.250 --> 00:17:32.590
Why not come with me?
To a place where you belong.

00:17:33.550 --> 00:17:35.590
A place where I belong?

00:17:49.560 --> 00:17:52.230
This is... beautiful!

00:18:01.030 --> 00:18:04.870
Would you stop crying already?
I mean, I understand, but...

00:18:05.330 --> 00:18:09.130
I can't believe I tried to kill Erika!

00:18:09.630 --> 00:18:11.540
And I still love her...

00:18:11.630 --> 00:18:12.840
You couldn't help it.

00:18:12.920 --> 00:18:16.380
You were chosen by the Azoth Sword.
You're no longer yourself.

00:18:17.930 --> 00:18:19.720
I don't remember it well.

00:18:20.140 --> 00:18:22.890
The Azoth Sword possessed me...

00:18:22.970 --> 00:18:29.060
Throughout time, a weapon will soak
in human blood and come alive.

00:18:29.940 --> 00:18:33.900
Gai. If it weren't...
If it weren't for you...

00:18:34.730 --> 00:18:37.820
A person's sorrow and despair
strengthens that life.

00:18:39.660 --> 00:18:41.740
And when the weapon awakens,

00:18:41.820 --> 00:18:45.790
it resides in those with a desire to kill,
and strengthens that desire.

00:18:49.250 --> 00:18:50.960
Where are we going?

00:18:51.540 --> 00:18:55.420
The Shoshidai.
A place that takes care of people like us.

00:18:55.880 --> 00:18:58.010
And there we will go to sleep.

00:18:58.090 --> 00:18:58.920
Sleep?

00:18:59.510 --> 00:19:02.890
You didn't kill her. That was good.

00:19:03.800 --> 00:19:08.020
If your killing rage had engulfed you,
you could've become a Busoma.

00:19:20.740 --> 00:19:21.700
Tatsumi?

00:19:23.910 --> 00:19:24.740
Gai...

00:19:25.280 --> 00:19:26.490
die!

00:19:27.500 --> 00:19:29.620
<i>Once you become a Busoma, it's over.</i>

00:19:30.290 --> 00:19:34.920
<i>You become the weapon itself, and
<i>the urge to kill takes over completely.</i></i>

00:19:38.010 --> 00:19:38.840
Gai!

00:19:39.510 --> 00:19:40.420
Sayaka.

00:19:42.010 --> 00:19:42.840
Stop!

00:19:51.310 --> 00:19:55.480
Gai, I've surpassed you!

00:19:58.900 --> 00:20:03.240
But even if we're okay now,
someday we'll become Busoma.

00:20:04.120 --> 00:20:07.370
The fate of one
who merges with a weapon is sealed.

00:20:07.450 --> 00:20:09.080
It's just a matter of time.

00:20:09.830 --> 00:20:12.500
That's why we have to sleep.

00:20:13.920 --> 00:20:16.590
Um, I have one favor to ask.

00:20:17.130 --> 00:20:18.000
What is it?

00:20:19.420 --> 00:20:22.010
Will you be my friend?

00:20:25.050 --> 00:20:26.510
You're funny!

00:20:26.970 --> 00:20:29.100
S-Sorry for being weird.

00:20:29.600 --> 00:20:32.520
No, it's okay. We're already friends.

00:20:33.690 --> 00:20:36.060
Ever since you stole the Azoth Sword.

00:20:48.700 --> 00:20:49.660
<i>Kill.</i>

00:20:50.790 --> 00:20:51.750
<i>Kill!</i>
